{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>ואחרי כל הבא עלינו</b> — a hint to the exile." "<b>חשכת למטה מעונינו</b> — as if You withheld and darkened from being written some of our iniquities in the book of remembrance, and You cast them down below to the earth, in the sense of: ותשליך במצולות ים כל חטאתם." "<b>כי אין לעמוד</b> — he explained: we have no worthiness to stand before You in this guilt."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:42:22.691414104Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}